<title>NETHERLANDS: DICO 1996 NET PROFIT 1.05 MLN GUILDERS.</title>
<headline>DICO 1996 NET PROFIT 1.05 MLN GUILDERS.</headline>
<dateline>UDEN, Netherlands 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit per shr (guilders)    2.35 vs  13.05 loss</p>
<p>    Net profit			     1.05 vs   5.8 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  1.00 vs   nil</p>
<p>    Turnover				 95.9 vs  97.2</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     2.2  vs   2.0</p>
<p>    Extraordinary charge		 0.24 vs   9.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Beds maker NV DICO International previously said it</p>
<p>expected to post a positive result in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
